OL,3,AUS singer Chris Brown to be sentenced
OL,4,Afor affray over London nightclub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS singer Chris Brown is due to be
OL,7,Fsentenced for affray over what
OL,8,Fprosecutors called "a vicious and
OL,9,Funprovoked attack" in a London
OL,10,Fnightclub in 2023
OL,12,FBrown, 37, pleaded guilty to the charge
OL,13,Fin July - what is 'affray'?
OL,15,FThe victim - music producer Abe Diaw -
OL,16,Fneeded hospital treatment for head and
OL,17,Fknee injuries, with CCTV showing Brown
OL,18,Fhitting Diaw on the head with a glass
OL,19,Fbottle several times
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
