OL,3,AUS singer Chris Brown to be sentenced
OL,4,Afor affray over London nightclub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown had been due to face a trial on
OL,7,Fmore serious charges, which he denied -
OL,8,Fincluding assault and attempting to
OL,9,Fcause grievous bodily harm - but they
OL,10,Fwere dropped
OL,12,FBrown's vocal coach, 40-year-old
OL,13,FOmololu Akinlolu, a rapper from
OL,14,FFlorida, also pleaded guilty to affray
OL,15,F- he's being sentenced today too
OL,17,FA group of Brown's fans are at court,
OL,18,Fwith one telling our reporter: "I want
OL,19,Fto be here to support Chris. It is part
OL,20,Fof history. I am hoping he gets a fine
OL,21,For a suspended sentence"
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
